  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola Pipeline Company, LLC (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) is a Texas limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola is owned 70% by Enterprise Midstream Companies LLC (Enterprise Midstream), a Texas limited liability company, 15% by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;MarkWest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; Energy Operating Company, L.L.C., a Texas limited liability company and 15% by Voyager Panola &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;HoldCo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Enterprise Midstream is an indirect wholly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;owned subsidiary of Enterprise Products Operating LLC (EPOLLC), a Texas limited liability company and the operator of Panola.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola is a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;n approximately&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;50-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;mile natural gas liquids (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;NGL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;) pipeline located entirely within the State of Texas that provides pipeline transportation services for mixed NGLs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The pipeline receives the NGLs at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;receipt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; points in east Texas and transports to delivery points in the Mont Belvieu, Texas area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;An expansion project of 10&amp;#8221; pipeline between Carthage and Lufkin, Texas loops the existing Panola system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The expansion converted an existing connection with West Texas LPG Pipeline at Lufkin, Texas into a delivery point that offers access to fractionation facilities in Louisiana.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Financial statements are prepared on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the accrual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;R&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;evenues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;are derived from transportation of NGLs under tariffs regulated by the FERC and the Railroad Commission of Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola invoices shippers upon receipt of product into the pipeline but only recognizes revenues upon product delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Revenues billed for product not yet delivered as of the balance sheet date are deferred until such time as the product is delivered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;with the exception of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; the Texas Franchise Tax, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;if applicable,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; does not recognize this liability on the company&amp;#8217;s financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of service (to be shown on page 700 of the Annual Report), Panola employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Panola has no employees of its own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;All operations, management and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC, as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;EPOLLC is reimbursed for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-size: 8pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
